  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Marco Pellegrino. Quick one, I promise, I'm parked in a loading zone in my delivery van so if a meter maid shows up, I'm blaming you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll take the heat. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow knocked over my mailbox. Flattened it. This is after that snow-to-rain storm that ended Monday, so it's been sitting there three days, and honestly I'm tired of stepping around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's annoying. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "130 Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill. I rent, so it's not even my post, but I'm the one stuck dealing with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 130 Ruggles. Was it knocked clean over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clean over, yeah. Post's leaning in the slush. Can you just log it? Because this keeps happening and nobody ever writes anything down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm logging it right now, mailbox struck by a plow after Monday's storm. Best number if a supervisor calls you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0164. Thanks, Denise. Now I gotta move this van."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:23:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go, go. Take care."
    }
  ],
